Modularized various common blocks
Neoclassical corrections to Zhdanov-Grad closure for impurities
Renamed Eirene interface directory from couple_SOLPS-ITER to couple_SOLPS_WG
Added new PARDISO solver option
Added b2mod_blns which produces the tracing/blnn_SPb.trc file
Added b2mod_convergence for potential equation inner iterations variables
Added b2mod_chord_interp for interpolation of fields onto arbitrary (R,Z) and along chords
Added b2mod_chord_interp_tri for interpolation of Eirene triangle quantities onto chords
Added b2mod_chords and cdfchord producing the chord output file b2chords.nc
